  "details": "Allow users to have a display name with at least 30 characters. Because I think its unfortunate that some people cant have a name they like. A friend of mine is trying to change her name and its telling her its too long even though we've seen people with LONGER names, I think thats a little unfair for their to be a restriction. I mean a little restriction is good, but im sure you know what I mean. But also have a username that people need to add you and allow it to where it has to be unique from others. But allowing the display name to be whatever, as it has no affect on how people add you.",
